    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<p data-start="203" data-end="774"><strong data-start="203" data-end="231">脱水马铃薯片</strong> 是许多食品行业的主要成分——从即食土豆泥到休闲食品, 汤, 和烘焙产品. 尽管它们的形式看似简单, 他们的生产涉及一系列精心控制的步骤, 每个对于实现一致的质量都至关重要, 功能性, 和食品安全. 本文提供了有关如何制作脱水马铃薯片的工业级全面概述, 纳入一个 <strong data-start="665" data-end="721">关键控制点 (中共) 食品安全视角</strong> 以及来自行业实践的真实生产见解.</p><hr data-start="776" data-end="779" /><div id="ez-toc-container" class="ez-toc-v2_0_85 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction"><div class="ez-toc-title-container"><p class="ez-toc-title" style="cursor:inherit">目录</p>
<span class="ez-toc-title-toggle"><a href="#" class="ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Table of Content"><span class="ez-toc-js-icon-con"><span class=""><span class="eztoc-hide" style="display:none;">切换</span><span class="ez-toc-icon-toggle-span"><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="list-377408" width="20px" height="20px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" class="arrow-unsorted-368013" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10px" height="10px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.2" baseProfile="tiny"><path d="M18.2 9.3l-6.2-6.3-6.2 6.3c-.2.2-.3.4-.3.7s.1.5.3.7c.2.2.4.3.7.3h11c.3 0 .5-.1.7-.3.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7zM5.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z"/></svg></span></span></span></a></span></div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1" href="#1_Introduction" >1. 介绍</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2" href="#2_Raw_Material_Selection_and_Quality_Considerations" >2. 原材料选择和质量考虑</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3" href="#21_Variety_and_Quality_Parameters" >2.1 品种及质量参数</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4" href="#3_Overview_of_Potato_Flakes_Production_Process" >3. 马铃薯片生产工艺概述</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5" href="#31_Raw_Material_Acceptance_and_Storage" >3.1 原料验收及储存</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6" href="#32_Stone_Removal_and_Washing" >3.2 石头清除和清洗</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#33_Steam_Peeling_and_Dry_Brushing" >3.3 蒸汽去皮和干刷</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#34_Post%E2%80%91Washing_and_Visual_Inspection" >3.4 清洗后和目视检查</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#4_Cutting_Blanching_Cooling_and_Mashing" >4. 切割, 热烫, 冷却, 和糖化</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10" href="#41_Hydraulic_Conveying_and_Slicing" >4.1 液压输送和切片</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-11" href="#42_Blanching" >4.2 热烫</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-12" href="#43_Cooling" >4.3 冷却</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-13" href="#44_Cooking" >4.4 烹饪</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-14" href="#5_Mashing_and_Drying" >5. 糖化和干燥</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-15" href="#51_Mashing" >5.1 糖化</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-16" href="#52_Drum_Drying" >5.2 滚筒干燥</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-17" href="#6_Flaking_Grinding_Sieving_and_Packaging" >6. 剥落, 磨削, 筛分, 和包装</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-18" href="#7_Critical_Control_Points_CCP_in_Potato_Flake_Production" >7. 关键控制点 (中共) 在马铃薯片生产中</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-19" href="#8_Quality_Assurance_and_Documentation" >8. 质量保证和文件</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-20" href="#9_Practical_Tips_for_Buyers_and_Process_Engineers" >9. 给买家和工艺工程师的实用技巧</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-21" href="#91_Evaluate_Raw_Material_Data" >9.1 评估原材料数据</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-22" href="#92_Assess_Supplier_Quality_Systems" >9.2 评估供应商质量体系</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-23" href="#93_Custom_Specifications_and_Functional_Testing" >9.3 定制规格和功能测试</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-24" href="#10_Conclusion" >10. 结论</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-25" href="#FAQs_about_Make_Dehydrated_Potato_Flakes" >制作脱水马铃薯片常见问题及解答</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-26" href="#What_types_of_potatoes_are_suitable_for_dehydrated_potato_flakes_production" >哪些类型的马铃薯适合生产脱水马铃薯片?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-27" href="#2%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_How_does_the_drum_drying_process_affect_potato_flake_quality" >2️⃣ 滚筒干燥过程如何影响马铃薯片品质?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-28" href="#3%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_What_quality_control_measures_ensure_safe_potato_flakes" >3️⃣ 哪些质量控制措施可确保马铃薯片的安全?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-29" href="#4%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_How_can_suppliers_ensure_consistent_flake_particle_size" >4️⃣ 供应商如何确保片状粒度一致?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-30" href="#5%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_How_do_HACCP_systems_improve_buyer_confidence" >5️⃣ HACCP 系统如何提高买家信心?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-31" href="#6%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_Can_dehydrated_potato_flakes_be_customized_for_specific_industrial_applications" >6️⃣ 脱水马铃薯片可以针对特定工业应用进行定制吗?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-32" href="#7%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_What_are_common_production_challenges_and_solutions" >7️⃣ 常见的生产挑战和解决方案有哪些?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-33" href="#8%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_How_should_buyers_evaluate_a_reliable_potato_flake_supplier" >8️⃣ 买家应该如何评价可靠的马铃薯片供应商?</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-34" href="#References" >参考 </a></li></ul></nav></div><h2 data-start="781" data-end="803"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="1_Introduction"></span><strong data-start="784" data-end="803">1. 介绍</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="805" data-end="1264">脱水土豆片煮熟, 脱水的, 以及由新鲜土豆制成的干制品. 它们必须保留理想的颜色, 味道, 功能性补液特性, 和营养价值. 根据雷姆等人的说法. (2019), 脱水马铃薯产品的品质受原料成分和加工条件的影响, 决定功能特性，例如溶解度和再水化性能 (DOI:10.1016/j.foodres.2019.108422).</p><p data-start="1266" data-end="1403">根据我们的实地经验, 稳定的原材料和严格的过程控制是可重复的产品质量的基础.</p><hr data-start="1405" data-end="1408" /><h2 data-start="1410" data-end="1469"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="2_Raw_Material_Selection_and_Quality_Considerations"></span><strong data-start="1413" data-end="1469">2. 原材料选择和质量考虑</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="1471" data-end="1513"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="21_Variety_and_Quality_Parameters"></span><strong data-start="1475" data-end="1513">2.1 品种及质量参数</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1515" data-end="1559">选择用于脱水的马铃薯必须具有:</p><ul data-start="1560" data-end="1668"><li data-start="1560" data-end="1589"><p data-start="1562" data-end="1589"><strong data-start="1562" data-end="1589">干物质含量高</strong></p></li><li data-start="1590" data-end="1621"><p data-start="1592" data-end="1621"><strong data-start="1592" data-end="1621">还原糖含量低</strong></p></li><li data-start="1622" data-end="1668"><p data-start="1624" data-end="1668">跨季节一致的生长条件</p></li></ul><p data-start="1670" data-end="1875">例如, 在我们的实践中, 选择用于薄片生产的品种通常具有 <strong data-start="1759" data-end="1792">干物质含量22%–24%</strong> 和 <strong data-start="1797" data-end="1833">将糖含量降低至以下 0.3%</strong>. 这些参数是控制的关键:</p><ul data-start="1876" data-end="1998"><li data-start="1876" data-end="1938"><p data-start="1878" data-end="1938">油炸加工品的颜色 (影响最终外观)</p></li><li data-start="1939" data-end="1998"><p data-start="1941" data-end="1998">热烫期间的功能行为, 烹饪, 和干燥</p></li></ul><p data-start="2000" data-end="2210">这些原材料基准与科学发现一致，表明干物质和糖含量显着影响产品性能 (史密斯 &amp; 威尔逊, 2021, DOI:10.1016/j.jfca.2020.103876).</p><hr data-start="2212" data-end="2215" /><h2 data-start="2217" data-end="2271"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_Overview_of_Potato_Flakes_Production_Process"></span><strong data-start="2220" data-end="2271">3. 马铃薯片生产工艺概述</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="2273" data-end="2462">以下步骤概述了 <strong data-start="2305" data-end="2348">标准工业生产顺序</strong> 用于脱水马铃薯片, 正如我们的 CCP 文件和质量与食品安全管理手册中所规定的.</p><hr data-start="2464" data-end="2467" /><h3 data-start="2469" data-end="2516"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="31_Raw_Material_Acceptance_and_Storage"></span><strong data-start="2473" data-end="2516">3.1 原料验收及储存</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="2518" data-end="2663"><li data-start="2518" data-end="2581"><p data-start="2520" data-end="2581">只有通过规格测试后才能接受马铃薯.</p></li><li data-start="2582" data-end="2660"><p data-start="2584" data-end="2660">控制储存条件以防止发芽和微生物生长.</p></li></ul><p data-start="2664" data-end="2763">此步骤确保在生产开始之前符合食品安全和功能要求.</p><hr data-start="2765" data-end="2768" /><h3 data-start="2770" data-end="2807"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="32_Stone_Removal_and_Washing"></span><strong data-start="2774" data-end="2807">3.2 石头清除和清洗</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2809" data-end="3091">马铃薯随水移动通过 <strong data-start="2844" data-end="2872">螺旋式去石器</strong>. 石块通过底部格栅落下并自动排出. 在此之后, 马铃薯在旋转清洗机中清洗，去除表面污垢, 沙, 通过翻滚和喷淋漂洗去除杂质.</p><p data-start="3093" data-end="3195">**<strong data-start="3095" data-end="3155">废水排至现场处理站</strong> 遵守环境标准.</p><hr data-start="3197" data-end="3200" /><h3 data-start="3202" data-end="3244"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="33_Steam_Peeling_and_Dry_Brushing"></span><strong data-start="3206" data-end="3244">3.3 蒸汽去皮和干刷</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><h4 data-start="3246" data-end="3266"><em data-start="3251" data-end="3266">蒸汽去皮</em></h4><ul data-start="3268" data-end="3391"><li data-start="3268" data-end="3331"><p data-start="3270" data-end="3331">马铃薯被输送到 PLC 系统下的蒸汽削皮机中.</p></li><li data-start="3332" data-end="3365"><p data-start="3334" data-end="3365"><strong data-start="3334" data-end="3352">蒸汽压力</strong>: 0.8–1.5兆帕</p></li><li data-start="3366" data-end="3391"><p data-start="3368" data-end="3391"><strong data-start="3368" data-end="3376">时间</strong>: 15–45 秒</p></li></ul><p data-start="3393" data-end="3460">蒸汽软化和松弛皮肤, 掉落在机器内部.</p><h4 data-start="3462" data-end="3481"><em data-start="3467" data-end="3481">干刷</em></h4><p data-start="3483" data-end="3613">用尼龙刷去除残留的皮肤. 气动和机械摩擦确保在后清洗之前完成剥离.</p><h5 data-start="3615" data-end="3639"><em data-start="3621" data-end="3639">残留物处理</em></h5><p data-start="3641" data-end="3769">收集果皮残留物并将其运输到农场或牲畜经营者作为饲料——这种做法支持废物增值.</p><hr data-start="3771" data-end="3774" /><h3 data-start="3776" data-end="3822"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="34_Post%E2%80%91Washing_and_Visual_Inspection"></span><strong data-start="3780" data-end="3822">3.4 清洗后和目视检查</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="3824" data-end="4061">刷完后, 马铃薯进入洗后滚筒，残留的皮迹被洗掉. 然后产品流到缓慢的分拣台上，人工检查员将眼睛移开, 绿色或黑色部分, 患病部位, 和外国材料.</p><p data-start="4063" data-end="4126">仅目视检查, 优质马铃薯进一步发展.</p><hr data-start="4128" data-end="4131" /><h2 data-start="4133" data-end="4183"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_Cutting_Blanching_Cooling_and_Mashing"></span><strong data-start="4136" data-end="4183">4. 切割, 热烫, 冷却, 和糖化</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="4185" data-end="4228"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="41_Hydraulic_Conveying_and_Slicing"></span><strong data-start="4189" data-end="4228">4.1 液压输送和切片</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="4230" data-end="4356">去皮和修剪的土豆被液压切片 <strong data-start="4283" data-end="4300">8–12 毫米厚</strong>, 通过循环泵系统重复使用水.</p><h3 data-start="4358" data-end="4379"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="42_Blanching"></span><strong data-start="4362" data-end="4379">4.2 热烫</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="4381" data-end="4401">热烫的作用是:</p><ul data-start="4402" data-end="4493"><li data-start="4402" data-end="4445"><p data-start="4404" data-end="4445">灭活酶 (过氧化物酶, 过氧化氢酶)</p></li><li data-start="4446" data-end="4463"><p data-start="4448" data-end="4463">减少褐变</p></li><li data-start="4464" data-end="4493"><p data-start="4466" data-end="4493">开始淀粉糊化</p></li></ul><p data-start="4495" data-end="4516">使用条件:</p><ul data-start="4517" data-end="4690"><li data-start="4517" data-end="4543"><p data-start="4519" data-end="4543"><strong data-start="4519" data-end="4534">温度</strong>: 65–83°C</p></li><li data-start="4544" data-end="4690"><p data-start="4546" data-end="4690"><strong data-start="4546" data-end="4558">期间</strong>: 15–35 分钟<br data-start="4573" data-end="4576" />(与 Jones 描述的标准热烫曲线一致 &amp; 棕色的, 2018, DOI:10.1016/饮食杂志2017.12.045).</p></li></ul><h3 data-start="4692" data-end="4711"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="43_Cooling"></span><strong data-start="4696" data-end="4711">4.3 冷却</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="4713" data-end="4835">热烫切片逆流冷却至 <strong data-start="4755" data-end="4765">≤30℃</strong>, 改善淀粉结构并减少糊状物中的游离淀粉.</p><h3 data-start="4837" data-end="4856"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="44_Cooking"></span><strong data-start="4841" data-end="4856">4.4 烹饪</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="4858" data-end="4990">切片在大气压下蒸煮 (〜92–99°C) 15–45 分钟, 产生完全糊化的淀粉和软化的组织.</p><hr data-start="4992" data-end="4995" /><h2 data-start="4997" data-end="5025"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_Mashing_and_Drying"></span><strong data-start="5000" data-end="5025">5. 糖化和干燥</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="5027" data-end="5046"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="51_Mashing"></span><strong data-start="5031" data-end="5046">5.1 糖化</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="5048" data-end="5242">煮熟的切片由螺旋进料器通过捣碎筛，形成一致的土豆泥. 乳化剂 (单甘油酯和二甘油酯) 和柠檬酸 (作为酸度调节剂) 被添加到:</p><ul data-start="5243" data-end="5338"><li data-start="5243" data-end="5271"><p data-start="5245" data-end="5271">防止酶促褐变</p></li><li data-start="5272" data-end="5302"><p data-start="5274" data-end="5302">提高抗氧化能力</p></li><li data-start="5303" data-end="5338"><p data-start="5305" data-end="5338">提高最终产品性能</p></li></ul><h3 data-start="5340" data-end="5363"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="52_Drum_Drying"></span><strong data-start="5344" data-end="5363">5.2 滚筒干燥</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="5365" data-end="5419">捣碎的产品被输送到滚筒干燥机，在那里:</p><ul data-start="5420" data-end="5555"><li data-start="5420" data-end="5452"><p data-start="5422" data-end="5452">涂敷 0.2–0.25 毫米层</p></li><li data-start="5453" data-end="5486"><p data-start="5455" data-end="5486"><strong data-start="5455" data-end="5473">蒸汽压力</strong>: 0.8–1.2兆帕</p></li><li data-start="5487" data-end="5520"><p data-start="5489" data-end="5520"><strong data-start="5489" data-end="5509">滚筒温度</strong>: 120–240°C</p></li><li data-start="5521" data-end="5555"><p data-start="5523" data-end="5555">下面水分减少 <strong data-start="5549" data-end="5555">9%</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start="5557" data-end="5641">滚筒速度和蒸汽压力的控制直接影响水分和堆积密度.</p><hr data-start="5643" data-end="5646" /><h2 data-start="5648" data-end="5699"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6_Flaking_Grinding_Sieving_and_Packaging"></span><strong data-start="5651" data-end="5699">6. 剥落, 磨削, 筛分, 和包装</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="5701" data-end="5888">干燥层被刮入预破碎机, 然后剥落成 <strong data-start="5762" data-end="5789">4–8 毫米雪花片</strong>. 通过筛分控制粒度分布 (16–40目) 根据客户规格.</p><p data-start="5890" data-end="5904">过筛后:</p><ul data-start="5905" data-end="6020"><li data-start="5905" data-end="5932"><p data-start="5907" data-end="5932"><strong data-start="5907" data-end="5932">磁力除铁</strong></p></li><li data-start="5933" data-end="5954"><p data-start="5935" data-end="5954"><strong data-start="5935" data-end="5954">金属检测</strong></p></li><li data-start="5955" data-end="5983"><p data-start="5957" data-end="5983"><strong data-start="5957" data-end="5983">称重和包装</strong></p></li><li data-start="5984" data-end="6020"><p data-start="5986" data-end="6020"><strong data-start="5986" data-end="6020">批量编码和日期打印</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start="6022" data-end="6100">≥8000 高斯的磁性除铁器确保拦截金属污染物.</p><hr data-start="6102" data-end="6105" /><h2 data-start="6107" data-end="6173"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="7_Critical_Control_Points_CCP_in_Potato_Flake_Production"></span><strong data-start="6110" data-end="6173">7. 关键控制点 (中共) 在马铃薯片生产中</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="6175" data-end="6251">食品安全和 CCP 合规性是生产不可或缺的一部分. 主要 CCP 包括:</p><div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" data-start="6253" data-end="6686"><thead data-start="6253" data-end="6285"><tr data-start="6253" data-end="6285"><th data-start="6253" data-end="6268" data-col-size="sm">工艺步骤</th><th data-start="6268" data-end="6285" data-col-size="md">控制焦点</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="6319" data-end="6686"><tr data-start="6319" data-end="6379"><td data-start="6319" data-end="6345" data-col-size="sm">原材料验收</td><td data-start="6345" data-end="6379" data-col-size="md">水分, 糖度, 缺陷</td></tr><tr data-start="6380" data-end="6438"><td data-start="6380" data-end="6398" data-col-size="sm">清洗/去皮</td><td data-start="6398" data-end="6438" data-col-size="md">包装合规性, 异物</td></tr><tr data-start="6439" data-end="6498"><td data-start="6439" data-end="6451" data-col-size="sm">热烫</td><td data-start="6451" data-end="6498" data-col-size="md">时间/温度控制以防止微生物风险</td></tr><tr data-start="6499" data-end="6524"><td data-start="6499" data-end="6508" data-col-size="sm">烘干</td><td data-start="6508" data-end="6524" data-col-size="md">水分 &lt;9%</td></tr><tr data-start="6525" data-end="6573"><td data-start="6525" data-end="6543" data-col-size="sm">剥片/筛分</td><td data-start="6543" data-end="6573" data-col-size="md">粒径分布</td></tr><tr data-start="6574" data-end="6631"><td data-start="6574" data-end="6592" data-col-size="sm">金属检测</td><td data-start="6592" data-end="6631" data-col-size="md">消除含铁污染物</td></tr><tr data-start="6632" data-end="6686"><td data-start="6632" data-end="6644" data-col-size="sm">包装</td><td data-start="6644" data-end="6686" data-col-size="md">精准贴标 &amp; 批次追溯</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-start="6688" data-end="6855">此 CCP 映射可实现可追溯性并确保符合 HACCP 等国际食品安全体系 (斯佩伯, 2017, DOI:10.1016/B978-0-12-384947-2.00011-3).</p><hr data-start="6857" data-end="6860" /><h2 data-start="6862" data-end="6907"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="8_Quality_Assurance_and_Documentation"></span><strong data-start="6865" data-end="6907">8. 质量保证和文件</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="6909" data-end="7027">支持这些流程的一致执行, 一个 <strong data-start="6963" data-end="7008">质量与食品安全管理手册</strong> 被维持. 它:</p><ul data-start="7028" data-end="7194"><li data-start="7028" data-end="7068"><p data-start="7030" data-end="7068">提供书面控制程序</p></li><li data-start="7069" data-end="7106"><p data-start="7071" data-end="7106">标准化检查频率</p></li><li data-start="7107" data-end="7148"><p data-start="7109" data-end="7148">确保产品历史的可追溯性</p></li><li data-start="7149" data-end="7194"><p data-start="7151" data-end="7194">支持遵守第三方审核</p></li></ul><p data-start="7196" data-end="7296">此类记录系统向国际买家和监管机构传达可靠性信息.</p><hr data-start="7298" data-end="7301" /><h2 data-start="7303" data-end="7360"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="9_Practical_Tips_for_Buyers_and_Process_Engineers"></span><strong data-start="7306" data-end="7360">9. 给买家和工艺工程师的实用技巧</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="7362" data-end="7400"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="91_Evaluate_Raw_Material_Data"></span><strong data-start="7366" data-end="7400">9.1 评估原材料数据</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="7402" data-end="7450">采购脱水马铃薯片时, 要求:</p><ul data-start="7451" data-end="7545"><li data-start="7451" data-end="7465"><p data-start="7453" data-end="7465">干物质 %</p></li><li data-start="7466" data-end="7489"><p data-start="7468" data-end="7489">降低血糖水平</p></li><li data-start="7490" data-end="7511"><p data-start="7492" data-end="7511">收货时的水分</p></li><li data-start="7512" data-end="7545"><p data-start="7514" data-end="7545">季节性处理策略</p></li></ul><p data-start="7547" data-end="7616">这些与客户应用程序中的功能性能相关.</p><hr data-start="7618" data-end="7621" /><h3 data-start="7623" data-end="7666"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="92_Assess_Supplier_Quality_Systems"></span><strong data-start="7627" data-end="7666">9.2 评估供应商质量体系</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="7668" data-end="7694">查找以下文档:</p><ul data-start="7695" data-end="7780"><li data-start="7695" data-end="7708"><p data-start="7697" data-end="7708">中共地图绘制</p></li><li data-start="7709" data-end="7731"><p data-start="7711" data-end="7731">HACCP实施</p></li><li data-start="7732" data-end="7757"><p data-start="7734" data-end="7757">在线检测数据</p></li><li data-start="7758" data-end="7780"><p data-start="7760" data-end="7780">金属探测日志</p></li></ul><p data-start="7782" data-end="7854">这减少了审计摩擦并加强了供应链风险管理.</p><hr data-start="7856" data-end="7859" /><h3 data-start="7861" data-end="7917"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="93_Custom_Specifications_and_Functional_Testing"></span><strong data-start="7865" data-end="7917">9.3 定制规格和功能测试</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="7919" data-end="7947">质量规格如:</p><ul data-start="7948" data-end="8011"><li data-start="7948" data-end="7967"><p data-start="7950" data-end="7967">补水比例</p></li><li data-start="7968" data-end="7996"><p data-start="7970" data-end="7996">粒径分布</p></li><li data-start="7997" data-end="8011"><p data-start="7999" data-end="8011">堆积密度</p></li></ul><p data-start="8013" data-end="8082">应在签订合同前商定, 并提供测试报告.</p><hr data-start="8084" data-end="8087" /><h2 data-start="8089" data-end="8110"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="10_Conclusion"></span><strong data-start="8092" data-end="8110">10. 结论</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="8112" data-end="8473">生产高质量的脱水马铃薯片是一个 <strong data-start="8165" data-end="8200">多方面的工业过程</strong> 结合原材料科学, 热处理和机械加工, 质量控制, 和食品安全管理. 通过了解每个步骤及其控制点, 制造商和 B2B 买家可以更好地调整绩效期望, 一致性, 和合规性.</p><hr data-start="8475" data-end="8478" /><h2 data-start="8480" data-end="8512"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="FAQs_about_Make_Dehydrated_Potato_Flakes"></span>制作脱水马铃薯片常见问题及解答<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="213" data-end="297"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_types_of_potatoes_are_suitable_for_dehydrated_potato_flakes_production"></span>哪些类型的马铃薯适合生产脱水马铃薯片?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="299" data-end="512"><strong data-start="299" data-end="310">回答:</strong><br data-start="310" data-end="313" />土豆与 <strong data-start="327" data-end="355">高干物质 (22–24%)</strong> 和 <strong data-start="360" data-end="390">低还原糖 (&lt;0.3%)</strong> 是首选. 这些确保颜色一致, 补液性能, 和工业应用中的功能质量.</p><hr data-start="514" data-end="517" /><h3 data-start="519" data-end="588"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="2%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_How_does_the_drum_drying_process_affect_potato_flake_quality"></span>2️⃣ 滚筒干燥过程如何影响马铃薯片品质?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="590" data-end="842"><strong data-start="590" data-end="601">回答:</strong><br data-start="601" data-end="604" />滚筒干燥控制水分含量 (&lt;9%), 堆积密度, 和颗粒结构. 蒸汽压力, 滚筒温度 (120–240°C), 和层厚 (0.2–0.25 毫米) 对于获得具有最佳再水化性能的均匀薄片至关重要.</p><hr data-start="844" data-end="847" /><h3 data-start="849" data-end="913"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_What_quality_control_measures_ensure_safe_potato_flakes"></span>3️⃣ 哪些质量控制措施可确保马铃薯片的安全?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="915" data-end="1181"><strong data-start="915" data-end="926">回答:</strong><br data-start="926" data-end="929" />关键控制点 (CCP) 包括原材料检验, 清洗和去皮, 热烫, 烘干, 剥落, 筛分, 磁力除铁, 金属检测, 和批次追溯, 全部记录在 <strong data-start="1135" data-end="1180">质量与食品安全管理手册</strong>.</p><hr data-start="1183" data-end="1186" /><h3 data-start="1188" data-end="1252"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_How_can_suppliers_ensure_consistent_flake_particle_size"></span>4️⃣ 供应商如何确保片状粒度一致?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1254" data-end="1462"><strong data-start="1254" data-end="1265">回答:</strong><br data-start="1265" data-end="1268" />通过精确控制薄片尺寸 <strong data-start="1309" data-end="1350">刨片机和研磨机设置 (10–40Hz)</strong>, 其次是 <strong data-start="1364" data-end="1388">筛分 (16–40目)</strong>. 这确保了工业配方的均匀补水和一致性.</p><hr data-start="1464" data-end="1467" /><h3 data-start="1469" data-end="1523"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_How_do_HACCP_systems_improve_buyer_confidence"></span>5️⃣ HACCP 系统如何提高买家信心?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1525" data-end="1724"><strong data-start="1525" data-end="1536">回答:</strong><br data-start="1536" data-end="1539" />符合 HACCP 的流程以及明确定义的 CCP 可防止污染, 跟踪关键参数, 并支持可追溯性, 让 B2B 买家对产品安全和质量放心.</p><hr data-start="1726" data-end="1729" /><h3 data-start="1731" data-end="1819"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_Can_dehydrated_potato_flakes_be_customized_for_specific_industrial_applications"></span>6️⃣ 脱水马铃薯片可以针对特定工业应用进行定制吗?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1821" data-end="2048"><strong data-start="1821" data-end="1832">回答:</strong><br data-start="1832" data-end="1835" />是的, 薄片可以调整为 <strong data-start="1867" data-end="1945">水分含量, 粒径, 堆积密度, 和补液性能</strong>, 允许制造商满足即食土豆泥的要求, 零食, 或烘焙产品.</p><hr data-start="2050" data-end="2053" /><h3 data-start="2055" data-end="2115"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="7%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_What_are_common_production_challenges_and_solutions"></span>7️⃣ 常见的生产挑战和解决方案有哪些?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2117" data-end="2364"><strong data-start="2117" data-end="2128">回答:</strong><br data-start="2128" data-end="2131" />挑战包括变色薄片, 补液不良, 和金属污染. 解决方案涉及严格的原材料选择, 温度和湿度控制, 在线检查, 和 <strong data-start="2318" data-end="2363">磁铁和金属检测系统</strong>.</p><hr data-start="2366" data-end="2369" /><h3 data-start="2371" data-end="2439"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="8%EF%B8%8F%E2%83%A3_How_should_buyers_evaluate_a_reliable_potato_flake_supplier"></span>8️⃣ 买家应该如何评价可靠的马铃薯片供应商?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2441" data-end="2631"><strong data-start="2441" data-end="2452">回答:</strong><br data-start="2452" data-end="2455" />关键指标包括稳定的原材料来源, 中共文件, HACCP实施, 流程透明, 可追溯的批次记录, 和技术支持能力.</p><hr /><p data-start="8480" data-end="8512"><a href="/zh/products/">我们的产品</a></p><p data-start="8480" data-end="8512"><a href="/zh/dinweys-bulk-potato-flakes/">土豆片</a></p><h2 data-start="8480" data-end="8512"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="References"></span><strong data-start="8483" data-end="8512">参考 </strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul data-start="8514" data-end="9309"><li style="list-style-type: none;"><ul data-start="8514" data-end="9309"><li data-